  "goodToKnow": "Das Zutun means someone's doing or involvement, used almost only in ohne jemandes Zutun: ohne mein Zutun (without my doing anything), ohne eigenes Zutun (through no fault or effort of one's own). Durch sein Zutun means through his help or action. It's a nominalised infinitive of zutun (to add), and colloquially, kein Auge zutun means not to sleep a wink. It has no plural."
